節。","example":"The model showed how an army could besiege the old city.","example_zh":"模型展示軍隊如何圍攻古城。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/besiege-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bewilder-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bewilder","sort_order":1,"sense":"使迷惑","alt_zh":"高中生站在安全低矮綠籬迷宮岔口，困惑查看無字地圖，成年導覽員在旁。","example":"The maze's many turns could bewilder a first-time visitor.","example_zh":"迷宮眾多轉彎，可能讓初次訪客迷惑。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bewilder-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bland-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bland","sort_order":1,"sense":"平淡的","alt_zh":"成年廚師在教學廚房準備把少量新鮮香草加入清湯，高中生觀察。","example":"The plain soup tasted bland until the cook added herbs.","example_zh":"清湯原本味道平淡，廚師加香草後才有滋味。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bland-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-blatant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"blatant","sort_order":1,"sense":"公然的","alt_zh":"成年參訪者試圖插隊，工作人員平靜請他回到隊尾，高中團體有序等候。","example":"The blatant disregard for the queue upset the waiting visitors.","example_zh":"公然無視排隊秩序，讓等候訪客不悅。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/blatant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bleak-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bleak","sort_order":1,"sense":"蕭條的","alt_zh":"冷清歷史車站在細雨與灰色天空下空無一人，無危險或悲劇畫面。","example":"The empty station looked bleak in the winter rain.","example_zh":"冬雨中的空車站顯得蕭條。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bleak-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-blight-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"blight","sort_order":1,"sense":"枯萎病","alt_zh":"成年農人與高中農業學生在田邊查看植物葉面枯褐病斑，無藥劑操作。","example":"The farmer examined leaves damaged by blight.","example_zh":"農民檢查受到枯萎病損害的葉片。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/blight-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bliss-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bliss","sort_order":1,"sense":"極樂","alt_zh":"高中女生在安全校園樹蔭長椅愉悅閱讀，周圍花木柔和寧靜。","example":"Reading beneath the quiet trees gave her a feeling of bliss.","example_zh":"在寧靜樹下閱讀，讓她感到無比幸福。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bliss-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-boon-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"boon","sort_order":1,"sense":"恩惠；益處","alt_zh":"高中生與成年居民開心沿穩固無障礙人行橋通過小溪，遠處可見學校。","example":"The new footbridge was a boon to residents who walked to school.","example_zh":"新人行橋為步行上學的居民帶來便利。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/boon-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-brash-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"brash","sort_order":1,"sense":"莽撞的","alt_zh":"高中小組會議中一名學生急著插話，成年老師溫和示意先聆聽其他同學。","example":"The brash speaker interrupted before hearing the full proposal.","example_zh":"那位莽撞講者未聽完整提案就插話。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/brash-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-brevity-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"brevity","sort_order":1,"sense":"簡短","alt_zh":"成年講者在校園講座簡短結束後邀高中觀眾舉手提問，氣氛活躍。","example":"The speech's brevity left more time for questions.","example_zh":"演說簡短，因此留下更多提問時間。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/brevity-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"