fcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/congenial-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-conjecture-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"conjecture","sort_order":1,"sense":"推測","alt_zh":"高中女生向同學提出模型橋支架想法，成年老師引導尚未開始的小砝碼實驗。","example":"Her explanation remained a conjecture until the test was complete.","example_zh":"測試完成前，她的解釋仍是推測。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/conjecture-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-connive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"connive","sort_order":1,"sense":"密謀","alt_zh":"高中生在文學課觀看兩名虛構成年角色在比賽桌旁低聲密談的插畫，無方法細節。","example":"The story's rivals connived to secure an unfair result.","example_zh":"故事中的對手密謀取得不公平結果。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/connive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-consecrate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"consecrate","sort_order":1,"sense":"奉獻；祝聖","alt_zh":"成年神職人員與成年居民在新小教堂舉行莊重祝聖，尊重宗教傳統，無文字。","example":"The community gathered to consecrate the new chapel.","example_zh":"社區聚集參加新小教堂的祝聖儀式。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/consecrate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-consolidate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"consolidate","sort_order":1,"sense":"鞏固；整合","alt_zh":"成年圖書館員與高中志工將不同來源書籍整齊整理到同一明亮閱覽室。","example":"The library will consolidate several small collections in one room.","example_zh":"圖書館將把數個小型收藏整合於一個房間。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/consolidate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-conspire-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"conspire","sort_order":1,"sense":"密謀","alt_zh":"歷史故事