rl":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/decimate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-defiance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"defiance","sort_order":1,"sense":"反抗","alt_zh":"高中女生在學生會平靜而堅定提出不同意見，成年老師與同學專注聆聽。","example":"Her quiet defiance showed when she refused to accept the unfair rule.","example_zh":"她拒絕接受不公平規則，展現沉靜反抗。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/defiance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-deft-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"deft","sort_order":1,"sense":"靈巧的","alt_zh":"成年工匠在安全工作桌細心組合小型木製機關，高中學徒旁觀。","example":"The deft craftsperson fitted the tiny wooden pieces together.","example_zh":"靈巧工匠把微小木零件接合。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/deft-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-defunct-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"defunct","sort_order":1,"sense":"已廢除的；停止運作的","alt_zh":"高中生與成年導覽員參觀改建成整潔展廳的歷史工廠，機械停止運轉。","example":"The defunct factory became an industrial museum.","example_zh":"停用工廠改成工業博物館。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/defunct-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-degenerate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"degenerate","sort_order":1,"sense":"退化","alt_zh":"成年園丁向高中生指出久未維護花園裡雜草蔓延、步道模糊的景象。","example":"Without maintenance, the tidy garden could degenerate into a tangle of weeds.","example_zh":"若缺乏維護，整齊花園可能退化成雜草叢。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/degenerate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-delineate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"delineate","sort_order":1,"sense":"描繪","alt_zh":"成年建築師在桌上清楚繪出花園步道圖面，高中生觀察，無可讀文字。","example":"The architect used a sketch to delineate the garden's main paths.","example_zh":"建築師用草圖描繪花園主要步道。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/delineate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-demise-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"demise","sort_order":1,"sense":"滅亡；衰亡","alt_zh":"成年歷史研究者與高中生在博物館查看已關閉商號模型與舊帳冊，無文字。","example":"The book traced the demise of the old trading company.","example_zh":"書中追溯老貿易公司的衰亡。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/demise-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-deride-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"deride","sort_order":1,"sense":"嘲笑","alt_zh":"成年輔導員在高中教室溫和制止取笑，鼓勵同學支持剛弄錯模型零件的學生，無侮辱文字。","example":"The counselor reminded students not to deride someone for making a mistake.","example_zh":"輔導員提醒學生，不要因別人犯錯而嘲笑。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/deride-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-despot-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"despot","sort_order":1,"sense":"暴君","alt_zh":"虛構歷史成年統治者冷淡坐在高位，成年村民平和提出供水請求，無傷害。","example":"The tale described a despot who ignored the villagers' needs.","example_zh":"故事描寫漠視村民需要的暴君。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/despot-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-detriment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"detriment","sort_order":1,"sense":"損害","alt_zh":"成年館員與高中志工將書移離屋頂漏水處，水桶接住滴水，無危險。","example":"The leaking roof was a detriment to the old library's books.","example_zh":"漏雨屋頂損害老圖書館藏書。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/detriment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-deviate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"deviate","sort_order":1,"sense":"偏離","alt_zh":"成年嚮導與高中生沿清楚有護欄步道行走，旁邊自然保育區不受干擾。","example":"The hikers did not deviate from the marked trail.","example_zh":"健行者沒有偏離指定步道。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/deviate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-devout-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"devout","sort_order":1,"sense":"虔誠的","alt_zh":"成年信眾在歷史神殿內莊重安靜祈禱，衣著完整，尊重呈現。","example":"The devout visitors paused quietly inside the shrine.","example_zh":"虔誠訪客在神殿內安靜停留。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/devout-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-diffuse-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"diffuse","sort_order":1,"sense":"擴散","alt_zh":"高中生在成年老師監督下觀察少量食用藍色色素在透明水杯散開。","example":"The blue dye began to diffuse through the water.","example_zh":"藍色染料開始在水中擴散。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/diffuse-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dilapidated-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dilapidated","sort_order":1,"sense":"破舊的","alt_zh":"成年工程師與高中訪客從安全圍欄外觀看空置老棚屋、斷木板和下垂屋頂。","example":"The dilapidated shed had broken boards and a sagging roof.","example_zh":"破舊棚屋有斷板與下垂屋頂。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dilapidated-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dire-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dire","sort_order":1,"sense":"可怕的；嚴重的","alt_zh":"乾旱村莊居民在安全社區取水點等待補給，成年救援志工送來密封飲水，尊重呈現。","example":"The village faced a dire shortage of clean water.","example_zh":"村莊面臨嚴重缺乏乾淨飲水的困境。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dire-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-disdain-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"disdain","sort_order":1,"sense":"鄙視","alt_zh":"成年虛構工藝評論者皺眉看桌上歪斜木盒，另一位老師引導高中生思考建設性回饋，無羞辱文字。","example":"His disdain for careless workmanship showed in his frown.","example_zh":"他皺眉，流露對粗糙工藝的鄙視。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/disdain-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dismal-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dismal","sort_order":1,"sense":"慘淡的","alt_zh":"空置舊車站在陰雲與枯草間顯得冷清，無人物受苦或危險。","example":"The abandoned station looked dismal beneath the grey sky.","example_zh":"灰天下廢棄車站顯得慘淡。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dismal-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dismay-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dismay","sort_order":1,"sense":"沮喪","alt_zh":"高中團隊看著桌上損壞木模型橋失望，成年老師溫柔鼓勵一起修好。","example":"The broken model filled the students with dismay.","example_zh":"模型壞掉，讓學生十分沮喪。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dismay-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-disparage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"disparage","sort_order":1,"sense":"貶低","alt_zh":"成年導師在工坊鼓勵高中同學尊重初學者的小木盒，大家溫和交流建議。","example":"The mentor asked the group not to disparage a beginner's work.","example_zh":"導師請小組不要貶低新手作品。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/disparage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dispatch-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dispatch","sort_order":1,"sense":"派遣","alt_zh":"成年協調員在社區中心向成年專業維修隊展示村莊地圖，隊員準備工具箱。","example":"The coordinator will dispatch a repair team to the village.","example_zh":"協調員將派遣維修隊前往村莊。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dispatch-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dispel-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dispel","sort_order":1,"sense":"消除","alt_zh":"成年老師在高中生面前展示穩固模型橋安全承受小砝碼，學生恍然微笑。","example":"The clear demonstration helped dispel our doubts about the design.","example_zh":"清楚示範幫助消除我們對設計的疑慮。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dispel-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-disperse-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"disperse","sort_order":1,"sense":"散開","alt_zh":"成年觀眾與高中生在禮堂表演結束後有序分流離開寬敞出口。","example":"The visitors began to disperse after the concert.","example_zh":"音樂會後，訪客開始散去。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/disperse-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dissent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dissent","sort_order":1,"sense":"異議","alt_zh":"高中學生會圓桌中一位同學提出不同模型方案，其他人與成年老師專注聆聽。","example":"The meeting allowed room for respectful dissent.","example_zh":"會議容許尊重彼此的異議。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dissent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dissipate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dissipate","sort_order":1,"sense":"消散","alt_zh":"安全山谷觀景臺遠望晨光逐漸照亮樹林，薄霧在空氣中散開。","example":"The morning mist began to dissipate as the sun rose.","example_zh":"太陽升起後，晨霧開始消散。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dissipate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-divert-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"divert","sort_order":1,"sense":"轉移","alt_zh":"成年交通人員在安全路口引導民用車輛走替代道路，遠處受損橋梁已封閉。","exampl